Proper saving is an expression of responsibility.
It protects families from vulnerability.
It creates flexibility during uncertainty.
It preserves dignity during hardship.
It allows individuals to continue contributing even when circumstances become difficult.
Within this framework, saving is not the opposite of generosity.
