The distinction is critical.
A person who saves responsibly creates resilience.
A person who hoards endlessly rarely achieves peace.
The steward preserves resources without becoming emotionally dependent upon them.
The hoarder seeks security through accumulation itself.
One creates stability.
The other often creates anxiety.
 
Sustainable Prosperity Requires Restraint
